{"name":"Darkroom","hex":"#2f1611","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"darkroom","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dark room, where photographs are developed.","A darkened room where sexual activity can take place, especially one in a gay club."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/darkroom"}],"entries":[{"title":"Darkroom","blocks":[{"text":"A darkroom is used to process photographic film, make prints and carry out other associated tasks. It is a room that can be made completely dark to allow the processing of light-sensitive photographic materials, including film and photographic paper. Various equipment is used in the darkroom, including an enlarger, baths containing chemicals, and running water."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/UCHSPhotoDarkRoom9.10.09ByLuigiNovi1.jpg/330px-UCHSPhotoDarkRoom9.10.09ByLuigiNovi1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkroom","wikidata":"Q601413"},{"title":"Darkroom (The Americans)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Darkroom\" is the tenth episode of the fifth season of the American period spy drama television series The Americans. It is the 62nd overall episode of the series and was written by executive producer Stephen Schiff, and directed by Sylvain White. It was released on FX on May 9, 2017."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Darkroom_(The_Americans)","wikidata":"Q50401162"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Self_portrait_in_the_darkroom_JPG01.jpg/500px-Self_portrait_in_the_darkroom_JPG01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Self_portrait_in_the_darkroom_JPG01.jpg/1280px-Self_portrait_in_the_darkroom_JPG01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb